    LLM: 'Game: GOPS. Objective: Win the most points by capturing the highest-value prize cards (Diamonds).',
    Player: 'GOPS: play by the rules, manage scoring opportunities, and pursue the win condition.',
    objective: 'Win the most points by capturing the highest-value prize cards (Diamonds).',
    gameplay: '1. Reveal: The top card of the Diamond (Prize) pile is turned face-up.\n2. Bid: Both players choose one card from their hand and place it face-down.\n3. Showdown: Both bid cards are revealed simultaneously.\n4. Award: The player with the higher bidding card wins the Diamond card and adds its value to their score.\n5. Discard: Both bidding cards are discarded regardless of who won.',
    keyRules: [
      'Symmetry: Because both players have the same cards, the only difference is the order in which they play them.',
      'No Re-use: Once you play your King, it is gone. If you waste your King on a 1ndpoint Ace, you have lost a massive strategic asset.',
      'Winning condition: Win the most points by capturing the highest-value prize cards (Diamonds).',
